{
  "tema": 7249,
  "slug": "varios-varias",
  "titulo": "Varios, varias (several, some)",
  "subtitulo": "Fui varias veces. Varios de mis amigos surfean.",
  "foto": "t01.jpg",
  "regla": "Varios / varias = several, some (more than two). It is always plural, agrees with the noun, goes before it with no article (varios amigos), and can stand alone as a pronoun or take de + the group: varios de mis amigos.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Varios** (masculine) and **varias** (feminine) = _several, some, a number of_."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "They only exist in the **plural** and agree with the noun: **varios días**, **varias veces**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "They go **before** the noun, with **no article**: **varios amigos**, never _unos varios amigos_."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "As a pronoun, alone: **Compré tomates; varios estaban podridos.**"
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "With a group, use **de** + article or possessive: **varios de mis amigos**, **varias de las olas**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "Tengo ==varios== amigos en Ensenada.",
              "en": "I have several friends in Ensenada."
            },
            {
              "es": "Fui a la playa ==varias== veces esta semana.",
              "en": "I went to the beach several times this week."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Varias== plantas de mi jardín ya dieron fruto.",
              "en": "Several plants in my garden already bore fruit."
            },
            {
              "es": "Vi ==varias== películas de ciencia ficción el fin de semana.",
              "en": "I watched several sci-fi movies over the weekend."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Varios de== mis compañeros de jiu-jitsu son cinturón negro.",
              "en": "Several of my jiu-jitsu teammates are black belts."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Varias de== las olas cerraron muy rápido.",
              "en": "Several of the waves closed out really fast."
            },
            {
              "es": "Compré tomates; ==varios== estaban podridos.",
              "en": "I bought tomatoes; several were rotten."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿Invitaste a tus primas? —Sí, y ==varias== vinieron.",
              "en": "Did you invite your cousins? —Yes, and several came."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
